---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="EPA Approval Letters | Smokeless Heat Blog" description="The EPA approval letters have arrived for the Vedolux 30, 37, 55, 350, and 450.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="text-ember text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">News</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl">EPA Approval Letters</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          The EPA approval letters have arrived for the Vedolux 30, 37, 55, 350, and 450.
        </p>

        <p>
          Approvals for the Vedolux 650 will take a few more weeks, as those test results were submitted after the first batch of reports.
        </p>

        <p>
          Wherever EPA-approved boilers are permitted for use, we are ready to sell. You can view the actual test results at this <a href="http://varmebaronen.com/nsps-approved-products/" class="text-ember hover:underline">link</a>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Here is a sample of one of the approval letters:
        </p>

        <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/epa-v450-approval-790x1024.png" alt="EPA V450 approval letter sample" class="mx-auto border border-wood/20 max-w-full" />
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
